2023, Wang et al. 2024)\n  - Weak supervision quality estimation literature\n  - Agent trajectory analysis beyond failure detection\n- Is the \"semantic residual\" concept novel or a restatement of known weak supervision limitations?\n- Does the circular evaluation finding generalize beyond this specific setup?\n- Is the negative result on temporal label models a genuine contribution or an expected outcome given the low-conflict regime?\n- How does this compare to concurrent work on agent monitoring (e.g., runtime guardrails, safety monitoring)?\n- Is the paper positioned correctly for a top ML venue, or would it fit better at a workshop or applications venue?\n\nReport your review in markdown format. Be thorough and critical but fair.","uuid":"2ce8d31a-db64-4289-8944-1d589a711a38","session_id":"30d69c72-8b86-43ec-89dc-36c5542ab0d3"}
