类器。因此之前 D039 基于不完整证据判 TLM 死亡过早。等\\\\n    σ=2.0 诊断结果再做最终判决。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: pending σ=2.0 diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: σ=3.0 negative, σ=2.0 untested\\\\n  - exp_id: structural_on_twv\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: label mismatch confound\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 写入 experiment_plan.yaml (32 experiments) + 更新 paper_framing.md 补充 OH cmd_rep\\\\n    消融数据 + 触发 dream_simulate(full) 验证 D039 framing\\\\n  rationale: D039 pivot 后 experiment_plan.yaml 一直为空，阻塞 coverage matrix 和 dream。现已写入\\\\n    32 个实验映射 5 个 claims，coverage 75%。framing 补充了 oh-cmdrep-ablation (+21.6pp)、encoder-agnostic、window-size、data-scaling\\\\n    四个新完成实验的数据。触发 dream full review 验证新 framing 在 EMNLP 审稿下是否站得住。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-cmdrep-ablation\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: F1 0.7512→0.9272 (+21.6pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: data-scaling-v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10-100% complete curve\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation-window-size\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: k=5 optimal 0.9309\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-full-finetune\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: macro_f1=0.7512\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: Baseline 数值引用规则：跨域 claim 统一用 cross-agent-structural (0.9674)，TWV 对比统一用\\\\n    structural-on-twv (0.9698)，禁止混用；补 3-seed 结构 baseline\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 paper_results_compilation 发现 cross-agent-structural (0.9674)\\\\n    与 structural-on-twv (0.9698) 差 0.24pp，论文同时引用两个数字会被审稿人质疑。同时 structural baseline\\\\n    均为单 seed 无方差，需补 3-seed。RF/GB sklearn 模型跑秒级，成本极低。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9674'\\\\n  - exp_id: structural-on-twv\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9698'\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n   